    "updated_at": "2026-05-16T12:31:52Z",
    "body": "Hello,\nThanks for reporting this, 0.12.0 should be available in maven, can you share the exact error you are having.\n`iosX64` target is removed in 0.12.0, if you are using that target you will have an issue updating to 0.12.0, can you double check you no longer need it and it's removed from the latest versions of Kotlin and Compose.",
