    "created_at": "2026-05-16T13:22:42Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-05-16T13:22:42Z",
    "body": "Thanks for the quick reply! \n \n You were right, the problem was on our side. We had iosX64() in all our KMP modules, that's why 0.12.0 couldn't resolve. After removing iosX64() from every module (kept only\n iosArm64() and iosSimulatorArm64()), 0.12.0 works fine now. \n \n For anyone else running into this: if you're on an Apple Silicon Mac and don't need the Intel simulator, just remove iosX64() from your build.gradle.kts files. Simulator still \n works via iosSimulatorArm64, real devices via iosArm64. \n \n Closing this. Thanks for the library!",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
